{"id":899,"bangumiId":899,"type":2,"name":"名探偵コナン","name_cn":"名侦探柯南","date":"1996-01-08","year":"1996","region":"jp","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/01/88/899_REwVW.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/01/88/899_REwVW.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/01/88/899_REwVW.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/01/88/899_REwVW.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/01/88/899_REwVW.jpg"},"summary":"主角工藤新一原本是一位颇具名声的高中生侦探，在目击黑暗组织的地下交易后，正准备追踪时却被突袭击昏，并被灌下代号为“APTX4869”（アポトキシン4869）的不明药物。后来虽然幸免于死，但身体就此缩小为小学时期的模样。之后他化名为江户川柯南，在邻居阿笠博士的建议下，寄住在女友毛利兰的父亲—侦探毛利小五郎家中，继续秘密从事追查黑暗组织的工作，并私下探寻获得解药的管道，希望能够恢复原来新一的样貌。与此同时，柯南凭着自己的推理天份，配合阿笠博士为他发明的道具，帮助毛利小五郎成为出名的大侦探。故事内容当中穿插许多爱情、友情、犯罪、背叛、复仇等情节。","rating":{"rank":908,"total":11669,"count":{"1":41,"2":14,"3":40,"4":96,"5":470,"6":1564,"7":3826,"8":3281,"9":1160,"10":1177},"score":7.5},"collection":{"on_hold":3775,"dropped":1291,"wish":1249,"collect":12027,"doing":10985},"tags":[{"name":"柯南","count":4918,"total_count":15346},{"name":"-完结摇摇无指日……","count":3897,"total_count":3937},{"name":"推理","count":3710,"total_count":75694},{"name":"名探偵コナン","count":3521,"total_count":17005},{"name":"万年小学生","count":2477,"total_count":2657},{"name":"青山刚昌","count":1605,"total_count":3092},{"name":"悬疑","count":1201,"total_count":117108},{"name":"TV","count":945,"total_count":1449881},{"name":"看到哪了","count":902,"total_count":1054},{"name":"ACG的启蒙作","count":541,"total_count":585},{"name":"坑","count":425,"total_count":2947},{"name":"漫画改","count":424,"total_count":893931},{"name":"1996","count":423,"total_count":5650},{"name":"童年","count":230,"total_count":94372},{"name":"日本","count":183,"total_count":316734},{"name":"名侦探柯南","count":147,"total_count":17375},{"name":"漫改","count":141,"total_count":370577},{"name":"TMS","count":127,"total_count":18758},{"name":"仓木麻衣","count":102,"total_count":233},{"name":"1996年1月","count":64,"total_count":127},{"name":"长篇","count":61,"total_count":2174}